# 止蝕
(pos:動詞)
<explanation>
yue:停止虧損；在投資或交易出現虧損時，採取行動（如賣出資產）以阻止虧損進一步擴大。
eng:to stop a loss; to cut losses
<eg>
yue:股價跌咗咁多，我決定止蝕離場。 (gau2 gaam3 dit3 zo2 gam2 do1, ngo5 syut3 ding6 zi6 sik6 lei4 coeng4.)
eng:Since the stock price has dropped so much, I decided to cut my losses and exit the market. [end of text]


